{
  "pros": [
    "Securely stores and manages passwords and OTP codes.",
    "Offers robust sharing capabilities for credentials within organizations.",
    "Autofill feature enhances daily productivity."
  ],
  "cons": [
    "Occasional issues with browser extension syncing or autofill consistency.",
    "Some advanced features or initial setup might have a slight learning curve.",
    "Lack of immediate in-app notifications for certain updates or changes."
  ],
  "changed": [
    "Pro 2: The note 'The personal vault Add menu has no Collection option; sharing requires first creating an organization from a 'New organization' link tucked into the vault filter sidebar.' and 'After creating the organization the app jumps from Password Manager into a separate Admin Console with its own sidebar, so my saved CRM and note items were not visible where collections and members are managed.' indicate that while sharing is possible and secure, the setup and management for it, especially for personal vaults transitioning to organizational sharing, is not always 'easy' or intuitive. The revised pro focuses on the 'robust capabilities' once an organization is set up, acknowledging the power while sidestepping the initial friction."
  ]
